    "question": "A housewife goes to the market. She spent 2/3 of her $150. How much does she have left?",
    "gold": "50",
    "answer": "The housewife has 3/3 - 2/3 = 1/3 of $150 left.\nThis means she has $150 * (1/3) = $<<150*(1/3)=50>>50 left.\n#### 50"
